5265:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *          - DMA transfer complete
5266:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *          - DMA half transfer
